      "id": "claim_694c16e307db47a09e4ae48dc2e71545",
      "statement": "Komodo operates as a deployment control plane consisting of five core services: dockerproxy (read-write), dockerproxy-ro (read-only), mongo (database), core (UI/API), and periphery (deployment agent with SOPS/age).",
