      "statement": "The dockerproxy service requires specific environment variables including ALLOW_ARCHIVE=1 for Compose inline configs, ALLOW_LOGS=1 for log streaming, ALLOW_START/STOP/RESTART=1 for container lifecycle, ALLOW_BUILD=1 and ALLOW_POST=1 for image operations, and ALLOW_CONTAINERS=1, ALLOW_IMAGES=1, ALLOW_NETWORKS=1, ALLOW_VOLUMES=1 for resource management.",
