      "statement": "The periphery service executes deployments using a custom image containing SOPS and age, decrypts secrets in-memory using age private keys from /config/keys, clones repositories to /etc/komodo/repos, builds stacks to /etc/komodo/builds, and deploys via the docker proxy.",
