    {
      "id": "claim_8a26a8c3d59a45cebfa92ac60d3d2012",
      "statement": "Komodo's deployment workflow involves: 1) Core storing stack configuration in MongoDB, 2) Triggering Periphery to begin deployment, 3) Periphery pulling repository commits, 4) Decrypting SOPS-encrypted secrets using age keys, 5) Rendering stack files with decrypted secrets, 6) Deploying via Docker proxy, and 7) Reporting status back to Core.",
